! Elyncia 01 ~ A Broken World ~ Spine

The history book: the Breakings, the Curse, the gods' changed presence, and the gazetteer of
every Nexus. Registers braid wonder-voice over rules-voice; the terminal-fiction frames (the
ddate login, the lares summon) bracket the book and stay with the spine as mortar.

''Spine law:'' the chunks live at their topical graph addresses; this spine holds the walk (the
reading order) and the mortar (the connective prose, written as chunks land). The kahea calls
below activate one by one as each chunk meme seats; until then the walk reads as the cut-plan.
''The source MD stays canonical until this spine renders the book whole.''

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/walk>>

!! The Walk ~ reading order

# `lar:///ha.ka.ba/elyncia/history/the-first-breaking` — YOLD 1, the War of the Immortals, the void flood, the Gaia portals
# `lar:///ha.ka.ba/elyncia/history/the-timeline` — the YOLD ledger, First Breaking to present (YOLD 5492)
# `lar:///ha.ka.ba/elyncia/history/the-second-breaking` — the Necrospire's return, the Day of Falling Stars, the Empire's fall (welds: concepts/the-necrospire)
# `lar:///ha.ka.ba/elyncia/concepts/curse-of-iron` — the rust-blight ecology, Named iron, the practice list, the three accounts
# `lar:///ha.ka.ba/elyncia/concepts/gods-after-the-breakings` — immanence modes: Immanent / Distributed / Demi-god agents; the embodied immortals
# `lar:///ha.ka.ba/elyncia/concepts/magitech-age` — bronze power-armor, laser swords, the jammer taxonomy, power cores
# `lar:///ha.ka.ba/elyncia/nexuses/` — the gazetteer walk: Eastern Net (new-delos ✓ · neo-thracia · olympian-marches · illyria ✓ · summerlands · winterlands · asgard · brimstone-mountains) then Western Net (verdant-coil · broken-isles · mu · khemet · hawaiki · the desert nexus), each a region-worksheet meme
# `lar:///ha.ka.ba/elyncia/concepts/present-state` — New Game+: the reopened Neo-Thracia, the factions in motion

//(Cut-plan Provisional; boundaries refine at the close read before each move.)//

